Crucible bounds every buffer it keeps¹ and draws nothing a model wrote as an    
escape². Press <Code>Ctrl</>+<Code>O</> to see a cut result; H<Quiet>₂</>O and x<Quiet>²</> read as written.          
                                                                                
<Quiet>▸</> <Bold>Why the record is bounded</>                                                     
  A store that grew with the session would spend the RSS budget.                
                                                                                
<Quiet>¹</><Quiet> CLAUDE.md, "Everything kept is bounded"</>                                       
<Quiet>²</><Quiet> markdown.rs, the rule the reader opens with</>
